{#n6}
It appears from hence, that in the Notion which this learned Divine gives us of *Enthusiasm,* he comprehends the _social_ or _popular_ Genius of the Passion; agreeably with what our Author in his [Letter concerning _Enthusiasm_ (_p._ 15, 16, 44, 45.)] has said of the Influence and Power of the _Assembly_ and _Auditory_ it-self, and of the communicative Force and rapid Progress of this extatick Fervor, once kindled, and set in action.

